'''Easter Island''' is the 33rd stage of [[Into the Future]]. In Chapter 2, [[Trolly Blogger]] is introduced. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] is unlocked as a rollable banner.

